"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.poster.avif?t=1786393912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.webm?t=1786393912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.mp4?t=1786393912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your tag meter by attacking opponents. You can use your meter to tag at any time, even tagging mid-combo to chain multiple characters' attacks together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your tag meter while under attack to bring in a teammate and punish the opponent - but take care that you don't get multiple fighters trapped in the enemy's moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three fighters per team, there's no limits to the team optimizations you can hone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.poster.avif?t=1786393912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.webm?t=1786393912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.mp4?t=1786393912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parable Academy has full voice acting for all playable fighters, and unique storybook-style cutscenes for each character's Arcade Mode intro and ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite teams to run through Parable Academy's multiple single-player modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> If you want to test out the game's controls and online netcode, download the free demo! Customization badges, unlockable content and single-player modes are locked to the full game.</p>",
        "short_description": "A one-button fighter that’ll have you hitting the books! Legends from classic fiction clash in 3 vs 3 tag battles. Unlock fighters in single-player skill challenges, then put your combos to the test in online play. Simple enough for newcomers to pick up, but plenty of strategic depth to be found!",
